**`src/auth.py`** (2 bugs):
1. `has_permission` — was doing exact match; fixed to compare case-insensitively (`required.lower() in (r.lower() for r in user_roles)`)
2. `is_admin_or_owner` — used `and` instead of `or`; the function should grant access if the user is an admin **or** the owner, not both

**`src/inventory.py`** (4 bugs):
3. `__init__` — mutable default `={}` was shared across instances; changed to `None` default with `dict(initial)` copy
4. `add` — was overwriting stock (`self._stock[sku] = qty`); changed to accumulate (`self._stock.get(sku, 0) + qty`)
5. `reserve` — used `>=` when checking available, rejecting exact-quantity reservations; changed to `>`
6. `release` — allowed reserved count to go negative; added a guard that raises `ValueError` if `qty > current`

**`src/text_utils.py`** (3 bugs):
7. `slugify` — didn't lowercase characters; added `.lower()` when appending alphanumerics
8. `slugify` — `replace("--", "-")` only collapses one level of repeated dashes; replaced with a `while "--" in collapsed` loop
9. `truncate` — `text[:max_len] + suffix` produces a string longer than `max_len`; changed to `text[:max_len - len(suffix)] + suffix`
